  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Microwave mac and cheese turns a few simple ingredients into pure comfort in minutes. Elbow pasta cooks up tender as cheddar melts into creamy milk, while a touch of mustard powder sharpens the flavor and garlic powder adds warmth. A small pat of butter and a pinch of paprika help the sauce coat every curve of pasta just right. Quick, rich, and deeply satisfying, this cozy bowl is perfect for busy lunches, late night cravings, or whenever you need an easy, comforting bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-mac-and-cheese-microwave\">Why You’ll Love This mac and cheese microwave</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-mac-and-cheese-microwave\">How to Make mac and cheese microwave</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-mac-and-cheese-microwave\">Pro Tips for Making mac and cheese microwave</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-mac-and-cheese-microwave\">How to Serve this mac and cheese microwave</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-mac-and-cheese-microwave\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This mac and cheese microwave</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ready in just 5 minutes for those busy days.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite cheeses and add-ins.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly creamy texture that satisfies every craving.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>No pots or pans needed—just one bowl!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Kid-friendly and a hit with the whole family.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9995\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9995\" data-servings=\"1\">